# orchestra - a study for play's part format (px32, notes/px32-format.md):
# a brass chorale over string tremolo, a crescendo from pp to ff, bells,
# timpani, tam-tam and cymbal at the climax, organ with pedal, choir and
# woodwind. Original music, written for pax by its px32 lane; about 31 s.
# tests/mpx3-orchestra judges it from the capture.
title Chorale over tremolo, an orchestra study
tempo 66
meter 4/4
part fl flute p pan -15
part ob oboe p pan 15
part hn horn p pan -35
part tpt trumpet mf pan 25
part tbn trombone p pan 40
part ch choir pp
part org organ pp pan -5
part ped pedal pp pan 5
part vn1 strings pp pan -60
part vn2 strings pp pan -30
part va strings pp pan 20
part vc strings pp pan 45
part cb strings pp pan 60
part tim timpani p pan 10
part bel bells f pan -20
part tt tamtam f pan 30
part cym cymbal f pan -40

